Verse 1:
[Fm]Come, ye sinners poor and [Cm]needy,
[Ab]Weak [Cm]and [Fm]wounded, sick [Db]and sore;
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]ready [Bbm/Db]stands [Cm]to [Fm]save you,
[Db]Full [Bbm]of [Fm]pity, love, [Cm]and power.

Refrain:
[Fm]I will arise [Cm]and [Fm]go to [Cm]Jesus,
[Fm]He [Eb/Bb]will embrace [Cm/G]me in [Db]His arms;
